      "id": "EXEC-011",
      "why": "D-0253: an installation with EXECUTE mechanically available but the operator has not opted in (NOESAR_EXECUTE_SANDBOX=disabled) refuses with a distinct, more accurate reason than the no-surface-at-all case — the two must never be confused",
